title Order flow
direction right

Online store {
  Customer {
    Start [type: event]
    Open website [type: activity]
    Place order [type: activity, icon: flag]
  }
  Warehouse {
    Approved? [type: gateway]
    Pack items
    Shipped [type: event]
  }
}

Start > Open website
Open website > Place order: Browse
Place order > Approved?
Approved? > Pack items: yes [color: green]
Approved? > Open website: no
Pack items > Shipped
